# Arcane spell names + descriptions.
spell-faerie_fire = Faerie Fire
spell-faerie_fire-desc = A wash of colored light clings to everything within a small zone, leaving creatures glowing and unable to hide. Attacks against the marked targets land more easily while the glow lasts.
spell-ray_of_enfeeblement = Ray of Enfeeblement
spell-ray_of_enfeeblement-desc = A withering beam of draining energy lances from your hand into a single foe. While the curse holds, the target's blows land weak, dealing only a fraction of their usual force.
spell-hold_person = Hold Person
spell-hold_person-desc = You seize the will of a chosen humanoid, locking their muscles rigid until the hold breaks.
spell-hold_monster = Hold Monster
spell-hold_monster-desc = You lock a creature's body in place, leaving it rigid and helpless until it can break the spell's grip.
spell-dissonant_whispers = Dissonant Whispers
spell-dissonant_whispers-desc = You breathe a jangling, off-key melody that only one chosen creature can hear, lancing its mind with searing pain. A victim who fails to steel its will is seized by terror and flees.
spell-hideous_laughter = Hideous Laughter
spell-hideous_laughter-desc = You flood a creature's mind with absurd, irresistible mirth, dropping it into helpless fits of laughter that leave it unable to act.
spell-irresistible_dance = Irresistible Dance
spell-irresistible_dance-desc = You set a comical, unstoppable jig into a creature's limbs, and it capers helplessly, unable to do anything but dance.
spell-mind_whip = Mind Whip
spell-mind_whip-desc = A sudden lash of mental force sears a single creature's thoughts. If the strike overwhelms it, the victim reels and struggles to marshal its actions for a moment.
spell-mind_sliver = Mind Sliver
spell-mind_sliver-desc = You jab a barbed spike of mental force into a creature's thoughts, searing its mind. The lingering ache muddles its focus.
spell-vicious_mockery = Vicious Mockery
spell-vicious_mockery-desc = You hurl a barbed taunt woven with subtle compulsion at a foe who can hear you, searing their mind with psychic pain. The sting throws off their aim.
